      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this, but it feels a little light for a board-level report. I'm worried it doesn't actually look \"thorough\" enough when they scan it. \n\nCan you expand on this and break the findings down into specific, detailed bullet points? I need to see more structure so it's clear we've looked into every single note. Just please make sure they are actually meaningful points—I don't want a bunch of fluff, just more granular detail extracted from those notes.",
